# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) single boot: chain + ADD="ImmersiveEngineering-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-35)
## SQ-CBO-35 | chain + ImmersiveEngineering-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 1 of 24: immersiveengineering$
expect effects items by namespace: .*\bimmersiveengineering=
bootexpect Lingerification: registered refinery list generator
shell grep -h "potion bottling done\|Lingerification: generated" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log
bootexpect Lingerification: generated [1-9]
kjsexpect potion bottling done \([1-9]
> zq recipes creativebrewing:bottling
sleep 3
expect recipes matching creativebrewing:bottling: [1-9]
bootreject PotionHelperMixin|PotionRecipeGeneratorsMixin
